	(descr "Molex 73100-0105 (0731000105) 50 ohm right-angle TH BNC jack. Recommended PCB pattern from Molex SD-73100-0105: origin at board edge on the axis, +Y onto the board; shell holes dia 1.80 at (+/-3.80, 4.60), center hole dia 0.92 at (0, 12.40). Body 21.80 x 9.65, 13.00 overhang. Pads: 1.80/0.92 center, 2.80/1.80 shell (drawing gives holes only). KiCad BNC_Amphenol_B6252HB-NPP3G-50_Horizontal does not match. Rec. PCB 2.40 mm; 3.00 mm pins still clear a 1.6 mm board.")
